# GRIT Interview Hub — Complete Product, UX, Authentication & Performance Improvement Brief

You are acting as a senior full-stack product engineer, UX architect, and design systems engineer.

Your task is to significantly improve the existing GRIT Interview Hub application, including its visual identity, user experience, authentication flows, email workflows, navigation, loading behavior, and operational access.

**This is an existing, functioning application. You are NOT building a new application from scratch.**

Your responsibility is to understand the current codebase, preserve its existing functionality, identify the root causes of the reported problems, and implement the improvements in a structured, production-conscious manner.

Do not blindly replace existing components, architecture, APIs, database logic, or authentication mechanisms.

