## Role-aware navigation

Expected behavior:

| User | Attempts to access | Expected behavior |
|---|---|---|
| Student | Student portal | Allow |
| Student | Interviewer portal | Redirect to Student portal |
| Student | Operations portal | Redirect to Student portal |
| Interviewer | Interviewer portal | Allow |
