- Never allow open redirects.

## Logout behavior

- Implement a reliable Supabase sign-out flow.
- Clear relevant client-side user state.
- Prevent stale authenticated UI from remaining visible.
- Redirect to the public homepage after logout.
- Provide immediate visual feedback while logout is processing.
- Handle logout failures properly.

