- Signup API implementation.
- Supabase `emailRedirectTo` configuration.
- Confirmation callback route.
- Token verification and session exchange.
- Production environment variables.
- Local development behavior.

Expected production destination:

`https://gritinterviewhub.vercel.app`

Ensure production confirmation links use the deployed domain.

Preserve localhost support for development.

Do not hardcode the production URL in multiple locations.

Use a centralized, validated application URL configuration.

Verify:

- Signup.
- Confirmation email delivery.
- Confirmation link opening.
- Token verification.
- Session establishment.
- Redirect to the correct next page.
- Invalid and expired confirmation tokens.
